# No AI co-author on GitHub

Never add `Co-authored-by:` trailers (Cursor, agents, or any AI identity) to git commits.

- Do not include `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` or any similar trailer
- Do not attribute commits to Cursor/agents in commit messages or GitHub metadata
- When creating commits, use only the user's author identity
